{"entryType":"UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)","primaryAccession":"B7JA34","uniProtkbId":"GNNA_ACIF2","entryAudit":{"firstPublicDate":"2024-03-27","lastAnnotationUpdateDate":"2026-09-02","lastSequenceUpdateDate":"2009-02-10","entryVersion":71,"sequenceVersion":1},"annotationScore":4.0,"organism":{"scientificName":"Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans (strain ATCC 23270 / DSM 14882 / CIP 104768 / NCIMB 8455)","commonName":"Ferrobacillus ferrooxidans (strain ATCC 23270)","taxonId":243159,"lineage":["Bacteria","Pseudomonadati","Pseudomonadota","Acidithiobacillia","Acidithiobacillales","Acidithiobacillaceae","Acidithiobacillus"]},"proteinExistence":"1: Evidence at protein level","proteinDescription":{"recommendedName":{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000305"}],"value":"UDP-N-acetylglucosamine 3-dehydrogenase"},"ecNumbers":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"15044494"}],"value":"1.1.1.374"}]},"alternativeNames":[{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"33200610"}],"value":"NAD(+)-dependent UDP-GlcNAc 3''-dehydrogenase"}}]},"genes":[{"geneName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"15044494"}],"value":"gnnA"},"orderedLocusNames":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000312","source":"EMBL","id":"ACK79142.1"}],"value":"AFE_1457"}]}],"comments":[{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"15044494"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"33200610"}],"value":"Oxidoreductase involved in the synthesis of 2,3-diamino-2,3-dideoxy-D-glucopyranose (GlcN3N), which is a component of lipid A in some species (PubMed:15044494). Catalyzes the NAD(+)-dependent oxidation of the glucosamine 3-position of UDP-N-acetyl-glucosamine (UDP-GlcNAc) to a ketone moiety, forming UDP-2-acetamido-3-dehydro-2-deoxy-alpha-D-glucopyranose (UDP-3-oxo-GlcNAc) (PubMed:15044494, PubMed:33200610). Is specific for UDP-GlcNAc, no activity is observed with